WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.114
Lab 2 uses the test tenant
from Chapters 4 to 7,

2
00:00:03.114 --> 00:00:07.587
with the diagnostic setting on and
at least a day of pilot traffic.

3
00:00:07.587 --> 00:00:09.400
Run the guide's freshness query.

4
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:13.533
Collect, check telemetry, and
compute the ring's metrics and exit,

5
00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:17.900
using your own ring record from the
template, kept on agency storage.

6
00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:21.962
Plan the rollback and file it with the
change record, without applying it.

7
00:00:21.962 --> 00:00:26.987
Record every run in a protected evidence
folder inside the boundary and check it.

8
00:00:26.987 --> 00:00:28.665
Nothing changed in the tenant,

9
00:00:28.665 --> 00:00:31.550
so there's nothing to back
out but the working copies.

10
00:00:31.550 --> 00:00:34.124
Then re-run the Zero Trust Assessment and

11
00:00:34.124 --> 00:00:36.925
point each network
finding at this evidence.

12
00:00:36.925 --> 00:00:38.980
The authors haven't run this lab.
